<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>TK广告数据抓取 - 设置</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../popup/popup.css" />
    <style>
      body {
        width: auto;
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px 16px 40px;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      h2 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .grid label {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
        gap: 10px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .grid label span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      textarea {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 100px;
        resize: vertical;
      }
      .footer-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 12px;
      }
      .note {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      #toast {
        position: fixed;
        right: 16px;
        bottom: 16px;
        background: #1f2937;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 10px 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: none;
      }
      #toast.show {
        display: block;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="header" style="padding: 0 0 12px">
      <div>
        <h1>插件设置</h1>
        <p class="sub">凭证仅保存在本机浏览器 storage，不会写入代码仓库</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>飞书多维表格</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <label>
          <span>App ID</span>
          <input type="text" id="appId" placeholder="cli_xxx" autocomplete="off" />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>App Secret</span>
          <input type="password" id="appSecret" placeholder="应用密钥" autocomplete="off" />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>App Token</span>
          <input type="text" id="appToken" placeholder="多维表格 app_token" />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>Table ID</span>
          <input type="text" id="tableId" placeholder="数据表 table_id" />
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="note">
        字段名需与文档《飞书表格建表说明》一致。应用需开通「多维表格」权限并授权到目标表格。
      </p>
      <div class="footer-actions">
        <button id="btnTest" class="btn">测试连接</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>店铺与写入</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <label>
          <span>默认店铺名</span>
          <input type="text" id="defaultStoreName" placeholder="无法识别时使用" />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>写入模式</span>
          <select id="writeMode">
            <option value="append">追加（MVP）</option>
            <option value="replace-day" disabled>覆盖当日（后续）</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label style="align-items: start">
          <span>店铺名称映射</span>
          <textarea
            id="storeMappings"
            placeholder="每行：页面识别名 => 飞书店铺名&#10;Deal to deal => Deal to deal&#10;SHOP INOUT => SHOP INOUT"
          ></textarea>
        </label>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>定时抓取</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <label class="row check" style="display: flex">
          <input type="checkbox" id="scheduleEnabled" />
          <span style="color: var(--text)">启用每日定时</span>
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>时间（本地）</span>
          <span style="display: flex; gap: 6px">
            <input type="number" id="scheduleHour" min="0" max="23" style="width: 80px" />
            <span>:</span>
            <input type="number" id="scheduleMinute" min="0" max="59" style="width: 80px" />
          </span>
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="note">
        默认建议中国 17:20（≈ 英国上午，抓「昨天」数据完整）。勿设早上 7–9 点：中国早上 8 点 ≈ 英国 0 点，花费是半截。
        业务日按英区后台时区 Europe/London。定时依赖紫鸟进程存活；无人值守用 Windows 计划任务 + ziniao-cli。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>默认抓取选项</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <label>
          <span>日期模式</span>
          <select id="dateMode">
            <option value="yesterday">昨天</option>
            <option value="today">今天</option>
            <option value="custom">自定义</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>自定义日期</span>
          <input type="date" id="customDate" />
        </label>
        <label class="row check" style="display: flex">
          <input type="checkbox" id="dryRun" />
          <span style="color: var(--text)">默认干跑（不写飞书）</span>
        </label>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="footer-actions">
      <button id="btnSave" class="btn primary">保存设置</button>
      <button id="btnClearLogs" class="btn">清空日志</button>
    </div>

    <div id="toast"></div>
    <script type="module" src="options.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
